PCHM30 RapliVx Linux 4.14 compatibility validation sentinel.

The build-time compatibility adapter lives at:
  scripts/ksu_raplivx_414_rules_policydb_compat.py

Run #24 reached final vmlinux link and exposed two post-4.14 API calls in the
pinned RapliVx transient source: seccomp_filter_release() and path_umount().
The adapter preserves the pinned source revision and maps only Linux 4.14 to
stock old-kernel primitives without altering stock seccomp/input code or CI
verification. This file is intentionally not referenced by any Makefile; its
location under drivers/** makes the focused compatibility change trigger the
path-filtered PCHM30 RapliVx workflow.
